  "name": "A Command on a creature makes the necromancer's Skeletal Archers' kill count, with level scaling on and off",
  "contract": "SoloKill.RequirePlayerHit (default 1): an ungrouped player gets experience from a creature only if they hit it themselves. A Command order to the necromancer's minions counts as that hit. A level-60 necromancer raises three Skeletal Archers 50076 with Animate 805040 and kills a first creature with a melee swing (experience). Then Command: Skeletal Archers 504319 on a second creature 35 yards away lets the archers kill it without another swing, and the necromancer still gets experience. A third creature the archers kill with no Command gives nothing. The same sequence runs for a necromancer with level scaling on and one with it off.",
